:: Thomas Hang Out End Early Low Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */

You turn to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span>, who looks pretty bored and uninterested, and tell him you have to go. The boy raises an eyebrow at you before sighing. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whatever. Don’t know why we even hung out anyway, considering we didn’t really do anything.”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> stretches his arms, his tone more than a little annoyed since you’ve basically wasted his limited free time.</span> <br>

