]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m going to try and get some shut eye before I have do some work later. Guess I’ll see you around.”</span> You feel a bit bad about having to end before <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> had any fun, wanting to tell him that you’ll make up for it next time, <span style="color:LightCoral">but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> is already gone.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Thomas" -3>>
