:: Thomas Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

You turn to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span>, who has what is almost a smile on his face, and say you have to head off. The boy raises an eyebrow before shrugging. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“So be it, I should probably be heading off as well, see if I can’t get some shut eye before I have to do some work later.”</span> He pauses for a moment, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But this was fun. More than I was expecting.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You smile, telling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> you are happy he had fun hanging out with you.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Thomas",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Happy",
            Eyes: "Tired",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whatever!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Thomas</span> cheeks flush a little as he turns away, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just before it wasn’t super boring doesn’t mean you have to be all proud of yourself. It just means this wasn’t a complete waste of my time… Maybe we can hang out again sometime, if I’m not busy!”</span> He says before walking off. <span style="color:LightGreen">You can’t help but smile at his bashfulness.</span> <br>
